    "body": "## What\n\nAdds `worker/concurrent.go` \u2014 parallel helpers for the settlement worker:\n\n- `AggregateTotals` / `SafeAggregate` \u2014 per-payer totals across batches\n- `CountAll` \u2014 parallel claim count\n- `CollectIDs` \u2014 gather claim ids\n- `NotifyFirst` / `BufferedFanIn` \u2014 small channel helpers\n- `SafeStore` \u2014 a guarded accumulator\n- `Config` \u2014 lazy one-time config init\n- `Poll` \u2014 tick until done\n\n## Testing\n\n`gofmt`, `go vet`, `go build`, `go test` all pass locally.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_019FtoBbsrGyBxSLTdgLe7tR)_",
